      "cml:premiseText": "(1) The Commissioner must, as soon as practicable after:  (a) the end of the 6 month period starting on the commencement of this Part; and  (b) the end of each subsequent 6 month period (if any) starting on or before the day determined under subsection 94Y(1);"
    },
